\pard\sa80\fs22 Processes markdown files across the entire repository, ensuring each file has a valid TOC and matching anchor tags above every H2/H3 heading. Files already in canonical form are left untouched. Scans all folders recursively (including docs/, configs/, src/, and root README.md). Results are logged to generated/logs/toc-anchor/.\par
